{"content":"<p class=\"preface-title\">參 考 書 目</p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">A.</span> <span class=\"latin\">T.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Robertson</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《與歷史研究相對照的新約希臘語語法》，羅伯遜（<span class=\"latin\">Archibald</span> <span class=\"latin\">Thomas</span> <span class=\"latin\">Robertson</span>）著，<span class=\"latin\">1914</span>年初版，<i><span class=\"latin\">A</span> <span class=\"latin\">Grammar</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span> <span class=\"latin\">in</span> <span class=\"latin\">Light</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">Historical</span> <span class=\"latin\">Research</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">1914</span>。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">BDAG</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《新約及早期基督教文獻希臘語大詞典》，鮑爾（<span class=\"latin\">W.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bauer</span>）德語原著。英語版第一版，<i><span class=\"latin\">A</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek-English</span> <span class=\"latin\">Lexicon</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">Other</span> <span class=\"latin\">Early</span> <span class=\"latin\">Christian</span> <span class=\"latin\">Literature</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">1st</span> <span class=\"latin\">Edition</span>，由阿恩特（<span class=\"latin\">William</span> <span class=\"latin\">F.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Arndt</span>）及金格里奇（<span class=\"latin\">F.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Wilbur</span> <span class=\"latin\">Gingrich</span>）合編。英語版第三版由丹克（<span class=\"latin\">Frederick</span> <span class=\"latin\">W.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Danker</span>）主編，<span class=\"latin\">2001</span>年芝加哥大學出版社出版。<span class=\"latin\">BDAG</span> 就是代表 <span class=\"latin\">Bauer</span>、<span class=\"latin\">Danker</span>、<span class=\"latin\">Arndt</span>、<span class=\"latin\">Gingrich</span> 四位辭典編纂者的名字。漢語版《新約及早期基督教文獻之希臘語大詞典》由麥啟新主編，麥陳惠惠、麥啟新中譯，<span class=\"latin\">2009</span>年漢語聖經協會出版。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">BDB</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《舊約希伯來語大詞典》，布朗（<span class=\"latin\">Brown</span>）、德賴法（<span class=\"latin\">Driver</span>）、布里格斯（<span class=\"latin\">Briggs</span>）合編，<span class=\"latin\">1906</span>年初版。<i><span class=\"latin\">A</span> <span class=\"latin\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">English</span> <span class=\"latin\">Lexicon</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Old</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span>：<span class=\"latin\">Based</span> <span class=\"latin\">on</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Lexicon</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">William</span> <span class=\"latin\">Gesenius</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">co-authored</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Brown</span>、<span class=\"latin\">Driver</span>、<span class=\"latin\">Briggs</span>，<span class=\"latin\">1906</span>，<span class=\"latin\">1980</span>，<span class=\"latin\">Oxford</span> <span class=\"latin\">Clarendon</span> <span class=\"latin\">Press</span>。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">BDF</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《新約及早期基督教文獻希臘語語法》，德語原著由弗里德利希·布拉斯（<span class=\"latin\">Friedrich</span> <span class=\"latin\">Blass</span>）和艾伯特·德布倫納（<span class=\"latin\">Albert</span> <span class=\"latin\">Debrunner</span>）於<span class=\"latin\">1896</span>年合著。英譯版 <i><span class=\"latin\">A</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek</span> <span class=\"latin\">Grammar</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">Other</span> <span class=\"latin\">Early</span> <span class=\"latin\">Christian</span> <span class=\"latin\">Literature</span></i>，由羅伯特·芬克（<span class=\"latin\">Robert</span> <span class=\"latin\">Funk</span>）譯著，<span class=\"latin\">1961</span>年芝加哥大學出版社出版。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">HALOT</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《舊約希伯來語阿拉米語大詞典》，科勒（<span class=\"latin\">Ludwig</span> <span class=\"latin\">Koehler</span>）、鮑姆加特納（<span class=\"latin\">Walter</span> <span class=\"latin\">Baumgartner</span>）合編，<i><span class=\"latin\">The</span> <span class=\"latin\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">Aramaic</span> <span class=\"latin\">Lexicon</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Old</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">2001</span>年 <span class=\"latin\">Brill</span> 出版社出版。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">KMP</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《新約希臘語進深：中級希臘語句法研究》，安德烈亞斯·科斯滕伯格（<span class=\"latin\">Andreas</span> <span class=\"latin\">Kostenberger</span>）、本傑明·默克爾（<span class=\"latin\">Benjamin</span> <span class=\"latin\">L.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Merkle</span>）、羅伯特·普拉默（<span class=\"latin\">Robert</span> <span class=\"latin\">L.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Plummer</span>）合編，<i><span class=\"latin\">Going</span> <span class=\"latin\">Deeper</span> <span class=\"latin\">with</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek:</span> <span class=\"latin\">an</span> <span class=\"latin\">Intermediate</span> <span class=\"latin\">Study</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Grammar</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">Syntax</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">2020</span>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">B&amp;H</span> <span class=\"latin\">Academic.</span>\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">LN</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《語義定義域新約希臘語詞典》，洛鄔（<span class=\"latin\">Johannes</span> <span class=\"latin\">P.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Louw</span>）、倪達（<span class=\"latin\">Eugene</span> <span class=\"latin\">A.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Nida</span>）合編，<span class=\"latin\">2019</span>年出版，<i><span class=\"latin\">Greek-English</span> <span class=\"latin\">Lexicon</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span> <span class=\"latin\">Based</span> <span class=\"latin\">on</span> <span class=\"latin\">Semantic</span> <span class=\"latin\">Domains</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Hendrickson</span> <span class=\"latin\">Publishers</span>，<span class=\"latin\">2019</span>。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">ME</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《中級新約希臘語語法》，大衛·馬修森（<span class=\"latin\">David</span> <span class=\"latin\">L.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Mathewson</span>）、埃洛蒂·埃米格（<span class=\"latin\">Elodie</span> <span class=\"latin\">Ballantine</span> <span class=\"latin\">Emig</span>）<span class=\"latin\">2016</span>年合編，<i><span class=\"latin\">Intermediate</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek</span> <span class=\"latin\">Grammar:</span> <span class=\"latin\">Syntax</span> <span class=\"latin\">for</span> <span class=\"latin\">Students</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">2016</span>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Baker</span> <span class=\"latin\">Academic.</span>\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">MM</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《紙莎草紙及其他非文學性資料所展示出的希臘語新約詞彙》，莫爾頓（<span class=\"latin\">James</span> <span class=\"latin\">Hope</span> <span class=\"latin\">Moulton</span>）、米利根（<span class=\"latin\">George</span> <span class=\"latin\">Milligan</span>）合編，<span class=\"latin\">1980</span>年出版，<i><span class=\"latin\">The</span> <span class=\"latin\">Vocabulary</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span> <span class=\"latin\">illustrated</span> <span class=\"latin\">from</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Papyri</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">Other</span> <span class=\"latin\">Non-Literary</span> <span class=\"latin\">Sources</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Eerdmans</span>，<span class=\"latin\">1980</span>。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">NA28</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《內斯特里、阿蘭合編的希臘語新約》第<span class=\"latin\">28</span>版，內斯特里（<span class=\"latin\">Nestle</span>）、阿蘭（<span class=\"latin\">Aland</span>）合編，<span class=\"latin\">2016</span>年德國聖經公會出版。<i><span class=\"latin\">Nestle-Aland</span> <span class=\"latin\">Novum</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testamentum</span> <span class=\"latin\">Graece</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">28th</span> <span class=\"latin\">revised</span> <span class=\"latin\">edition,</span> <span class=\"latin\">2016</span>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Deutsche</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bibelgesellschaft</span>。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">SNT</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《新約同義詞近義詞講義》，特倫丘（<span class=\"latin\">Richard</span> <span class=\"latin\">C.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Trench</span>）著，第<span class=\"latin\">9</span>版於<span class=\"latin\">1978</span>年出版，<i><span class=\"latin\">Synonyms</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">The</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">9th</span> <span class=\"latin\">edition</span>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Eerdmans</span>，<span class=\"latin\">1978</span>。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">TC</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《希臘語新約文本註釋》第<span class=\"latin\">2</span>版，梅茨格（<span class=\"latin\">Bruce</span> <span class=\"latin\">M.</span>\n      <span class=\"latin\">Metzger</span>）主編：<span class=\"latin\">1994</span>年聯合聖經公會出版。<i><span class=\"latin\">A</span> <span class=\"latin\">Textual</span> <span class=\"latin\">Commentary</span> <span class=\"latin\">on</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">2nd</span> <span class=\"latin\">Edition</span>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">jointly</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Deutsche</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bibelgesellschaft</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">United</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bible</span> <span class=\"latin\">Societies</span>，<span class=\"latin\">1994.</span>\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">TDNT</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《新約神學詞典》，基特爾（<span class=\"latin\">Gerhard</span> <span class=\"latin\">Kittel</span>）弗里德里希（<span class=\"latin\">Gerhard</span>\n      <span class=\"latin\">Friedrich</span>）合編，<i><span class=\"latin\">Theological</span> <span class=\"latin\">Dictionary</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">edited</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Gerhard</span> <span class=\"latin\">Kittel</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">Gerhard</span> <span class=\"latin\">Friedrich.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Abridged</span> <span class=\"latin\">edition</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Geoffrey</span> <span class=\"latin\">W.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bromiley.</span>\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">THAY</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《新約希臘語大詞典》，賽雅（<span class=\"latin\">Joseph</span> <span class=\"latin\">H.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Thayer</span>）主編，<i><span class=\"latin\">A</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek-English</span> <span class=\"latin\">Lexicon</span> <span class=\"latin\">of</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Hendrickson</span> <span class=\"latin\">Publishers</span>，<span class=\"latin\">1995.</span>\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">UBS5</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《希臘語新約》第<span class=\"latin\">5</span>版，<span class=\"latin\">B</span>·阿蘭（<span class=\"latin\">Barbara</span> <span class=\"latin\">Aland</span>）、<span class=\"latin\">K</span>·阿蘭（<span class=\"latin\">Kurt</span> <span class=\"latin\">Aland</span>）、卡拉維多普洛斯（<span class=\"latin\">Johannes</span> <span class=\"latin\">Karavidopoulos</span>）、馬蒂尼（<span class=\"latin\">Carlo</span> <span class=\"latin\">Martini</span>）、梅茨格（<span class=\"latin\">Bruce</span> <span class=\"latin\">Metzger</span>）合編，<span class=\"latin\">2014</span>年聯合聖經公會出版。<i><span class=\"latin\">The</span> <span class=\"latin\">Greek</span> <span class=\"latin\">New</span> <span class=\"latin\">Testament</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">5th</span> <span class=\"latin\">Edition.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Published</span>\n      <span class=\"latin\">jointly</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Deutsche</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bibelgesellschaft</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">American</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bible</span> <span class=\"latin\">Society</span> <span class=\"latin\">and</span> <span class=\"latin\">United</span> <span class=\"latin\">Bible</span> <span class=\"latin\">Societies,</span> <span class=\"latin\">2014</span>。\n    </p><p class=\"preface-para2\">\n      <b><span class=\"latin\">Wallace</span></b>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《進階中級希臘語語法》，丹尼爾·華萊士（<span class=\"latin\">Daniel</span> <span class=\"latin\">B.</span> <span class=\"latin\">Wallace</span>）著，<span class=\"latin\">1996</span>年初版，<i><span class=\"latin\">Greek</span> <span class=\"latin\">Grammar</span> <span class=\"latin\">Beyond</span> <span class=\"latin\">the</span> <span class=\"latin\">Basics</span></i>，<span class=\"latin\">published</span> <span class=\"latin\">by</span> <span class=\"latin\">Zonderan,</span> <span class=\"latin\">1996</span>。\n    </p>"}